    "detailed_description": "Isometric trucking adventure that's all about skill, strategy, and, of course, trucks!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat Makes 'Truck Job' Special?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA variety of challenging levels, from serene day drives to perilous night routes.<br />\r\nDiverse obstacles and time trials that will test your driving mettle.<br />\r\nGorgeous low poly 3D graphics that make every journey a visual treat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe objective of the game is simple:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArrive safely with the truck trailer and park it in the designated area.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you do it?",
    "about_the_game": "Isometric trucking adventure that's all about skill, strategy, and, of course, trucks!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat Makes 'Truck Job' Special?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA variety of challenging levels, from serene day drives to perilous night routes.<br />\r\nDiverse obstacles and time trials that will test your driving mettle.<br />\r\nGorgeous low poly 3D graphics that make every journey a visual treat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe objective of the game is simple:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArrive safely with the truck trailer and park it in the designated area.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you do it?",
